WEBVTT

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:30.130
Dit word gaokao genoem en
80 miljoen Sjinese hoërskool leerders

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.500
het reeds dié veeleisende toets afgelê.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:34.780
Die intensiteit om Engels te leer

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:38.670
is amper ondenkbaar,
tensy jy dit aanskou.

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:40.520
Onderwyser: Perfect!
Studente: Perfek!

00:02:40.520 --> 00:02:43.310
O: Perfect! 
S: Perfek!

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:45.530
O: I want to speak perfect English!

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:47.920
S: Ek wil perfekte Engels praat!

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.110
O: I want to speak ...
S: Ek wil ...

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:53.030
O: ... perfect English.
S: ... perfekte Engels praat.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:56.330
O (gil harder): I want to change my life!

00:02:56.330 --> 00:03:00.010
S (gil harder): Ek wil my lewe verander!